"""
Airline vendor matching on rows_overlap   (hotel pipeline ka airline version)

Hotel se 2 bade differences:
  1. Airline = ek single entity. "AMERICAN AIRLINES JFK" aur "American Airlines"
     SAME hain. Hotel wala location-discriminator logic yahan NAHI chahiye.
     Isi wajah se LLM calls bahut kam honge.
  2. Card descriptor me aksar IATA ticket prefix hota hai:
     "AMERICAN AIR0012345678901" -> 001 = American. Ye deterministic signal hai,
     name dekhne ki zarurat hi nahi padti.

Flow:
  CELL 1  config + client + counter
  CELL 2  normalization + carrier table (names + IATA prefix + 2-letter code)
  CELL 3  brute force  -> "yes" / "no" / "unsure"
  CELL 4  LLM layer (counted)
  CELL 5  DRY RUN -> exact LLM call count
  CELL 6  resolve unique pairs
  CELL 7  apply back to r1
"""

